# SLES layer 00: the desktop base a *minimal* SLES 16.1 Immutable install lacks.
# On the KDE install these arrived implicitly with patterns kde_plasma/x11/fonts.
# Installed in the same pending snapshot as layers 01-03 (only what the next boot lacks).
# The display manager (SDDM, decision D-1) is handled by install.sh: only when the next
# boot has no display manager or already uses SDDM.
# Audio
pipewire
wireplumber
pipewire-pulseaudio
pipewire-alsa
# Graphics
Mesa-dri
Mesa-libEGL1
Mesa-libGL1
libvulkan1
libvulkan_lvp
xwayland
# Desktop services
polkit
udisks2
upower
power-profiles-daemon
bluez
gvfs
# XDG plumbing
xdg-user-dirs
xdg-utils
xdg-desktop-portal
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
gsettings-desktop-schemas
glib2-tools
dconf
# Icons, fonts
adwaita-icon-theme
hicolor-icon-theme
fontconfig
google-noto-sans-fonts
google-noto-coloremoji-fonts
# Flatpak (Chromium, Flathub targets of omarchy pkg add)
flatpak
# Commands Omarchy scripts call (update-desktop-database: omarchy-refresh-applications,
# run by omarchy-provision-user; pkexec: theme-set-browser, stay-awake, docker TUI)
desktop-file-utils
pkexec
ImageMagick
socat
inotify-tools
xsetroot
python3
# Runtime libraries of the userland Ghostty bundle (nothing else pulls them)
libgtk-4-1
libappstream5
libgraphene-1_0-0
